---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Base lang="en" title="Hortus de Escapismo · Fudan Imaginative World Creators' Club"
      description="Paradise stranded in the barrens, and still the flowers bloom. Unofficial site of the Fudan Imaginative World Creators' Club."
      active="about" themeClass="home" headerClass="over-abyss" canvas="vigil">

<section class="vigil">
  <div class="vigil-content">
    <svg class="big-halo" viewBox="0 0 130 130" aria-hidden="true">
      <ellipse cx="65" cy="65" rx="52" ry="20" transform="rotate(-14 65 65)"/>
      <ellipse class="inner" cx="65" cy="65" rx="38" ry="14" transform="rotate(10 65 65)"/>
    </svg>
    <h1 class="vigil-title latin-hero" data-kinetic>HORTUS</h1>
    <div class="vigil-latin">空 想 花 庭 · DE&nbsp;ESCAPISMO</div>
    <div class="vigil-ticker" data-ticker="SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · SIGNAL LOST · 60 YEARS||HORTUS DE ESCAPISMO · THE GARDEN ENDURES||EMPATHY LINK ESTABLISHED · WELCOME, PILGRIM"></div>
  </div>

  <span class="scatter latin" style="top:24%;left:9%">An unofficial site of the Fudan Imaginative World Creators' Club.</span>
  <span class="scatter latin" style="top:33%;right:8%">One house rule only: the original.</span>
  <span class="scatter latin" style="top:47%;left:14%">Novels, paintings, characters, worlds — made by the gardeners themselves.</span>
  <span class="scatter latin" style="top:58%;right:12%">A monastery stranded in the barrens, and still the flowers bloom.</span>
  <span class="scatter latin" style="top:70%;left:20%">You are walking the cloister before dawn.</span>
  <span class="scatter latin" style="top:80%;right:22%">Descend — the manuscript wakes below.</span>

  <div class="scroll-cue">SCROLL · STEP DOWN INTO DAY</div>
</section>

<div class="walk">

  <section class="doorway">
    <div class="door-caption">PORTA PRIMA · 修士名录</div>
    <a class="door" href="/en/members/">
      <div class="door-window-side">
        <div class="door-arch">
          <svg class="halo-mini" viewBox="0 0 74 74" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="37" cy="37" rx="30" ry="11" transform="rotate(-14 37 37)"/></svg>
          <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="17" r="7"/><path d="M10 40 C10 31 16 27 24 27 C32 27 38 31 38 40"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="door-body">
        <h3 class="latin" data-scramble="The Friars">The Friars</h3>
        <div class="meta">Lib. I · Residents</div>
        <p>The residents of this monastery — writers, painters, worldwrights. Every gardener keeps a plot of their own, and every plot is on the register.</p>
        <span class="enter">Enter <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 h14 M13 6 l6 6 -6 6"/></svg></span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <div class="band" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>PARADISUS IN EREMO · LEX DAT · SENSUS CONIUNGIT · FLORES MANENT · FIDES FLORET · PARADISUS IN EREMO · LEX DAT · SENSUS CONIUNGIT · FLORES MANENT · FIDES FLORET ·&nbsp;</span>
    <span>PARADISUS IN EREMO · LEX DAT · SENSUS CONIUNGIT · FLORES MANENT · FIDES FLORET · PARADISUS IN EREMO · LEX DAT · SENSUS CONIUNGIT · FLORES MANENT · FIDES FLORET ·&nbsp;</span>
  </div>

  <section class="doorway">
    <div class="door-caption">PORTA SECUNDA · 活动志</div>
    <a class="door rev" href="/en/activities/">
      <div class="door-window-side">
        <div class="door-arch">
          <svg class="halo-mini" viewBox="0 0 74 74" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="37" cy="37" rx="30" ry="11" transform="rotate(-14 37 37)"/></svg>
          <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8 h20 l4 6 v26 h-24 z"/><path d="M32 8 v6 h4 M17 20 h14 M17 27 h14 M17 34 h9"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="door-body">
        <h3 class="latin" data-scramble="The Chronicle">The Chronicle</h3>
        <div class="meta">Lib. II · Annals</div>
        <p>Fiction festivals, joint projects, lectures — everything that happened within these walls, recorded year by year.</p>
        <span class="enter">Enter <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 h14 M13 6 l6 6 -6 6"/></svg></span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <div class="band" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · NON PARADISUS SED DOMUS · SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · NON PARADISUS SED DOMUS ·&nbsp;</span>
    <span>SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · NON PARADISUS SED DOMUS · SANCTILAMINIUM AMBROSII · NON PARADISUS SED DOMUS ·&nbsp;</span>
  </div>

  <section class="doorway">
    <div class="door-caption">PORTA TERTIA · 花庭</div>
    <a class="door" href="/en/works/">
      <div class="door-window-side">
        <div class="door-arch">
          <svg class="halo-mini" viewBox="0 0 74 74" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="37" cy="37" rx="30" ry="11" transform="rotate(-14 37 37)"/></svg>
          <svg class="glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 6 C20 14 14 18 8 19 C14 20 20 24 24 32 C28 24 34 20 40 19 C34 18 28 14 24 6 Z"/><path d="M24 32 L24 42"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="door-body">
        <h3 class="latin" data-scramble="The Garden">The Garden</h3>
        <div class="meta">Lib. III · Creations</div>
        <p>Novels, paintings, settings and everything made — prose in chapbooks, paintings along the cloister, settings in the register.</p>
        <span class="enter">Enter <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12 h14 M13 6 l6 6 -6 6"/></svg></span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <div class="walk-inner epilogue">
    <section class="section-title reveal"><h2 class="latin">Who we are</h2></section>
    <div class="card reveal">
      <p>The name borrows from the Arknights SideStory <em>Hortus de Escapismo</em>: in a wandering monastery stranded upon the barrens, a gardener keeps planting flowers. We believe creation means the same — no paradise required, only a habitable plot of flowers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card reveal" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
      <p>To enter the garden: bring us your unfinished world. Festivals and joint projects open on a yearly cycle — see the <a href="/en/activities/">Chronicle</a>; for daily life, follow the WeChat account 「空想花庭」.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<Footer lang="en" mid="index" />
</Base>
